+| BISW1080P133 | The Lumeelle Cluster Pendant | refined pendant for an elder sister or milestone birthday |
+
+## Type 3 concept
+
+The three slots form one birthday morning story in a warm Indian home. Wrapped boxes, flowers, ribbon, a ceramic cup, and a closed book provide physical context. No screens, blank cards, boards, placards, readable text, logos, or extra jewellery appear.
+
+* Hero: two fair skinned adult Indian sisters sharing a warm birthday gift moment. The recipient physically wears The Rohal Huggie Earrings at the exact body image scale. The featured image is not repeated in the body.
+* Flatlay: The Viperine Twist Ring in a `linen-bedside` setting with rumpled linen, a closed title free book, soft lamp glow, ribbon, and a small wrapped box. No people or hands.
+* Lifestyle: a fair skinned adult Indian sister tying ribbon around a gift while physically wearing The Keeper Multiwearable Charm on a fine bracelet at the exact body image scale.
+
+Type 3 SKU plan:
+
+| Slot | SKU | Product | Body image gate |
