+
+## Article structure
+
+1. Direct answer introduction with the primary keyword in the opening paragraph
+2. TL;DR with quick gift directions by style and sizing confidence
+3. Birthday gift quick picks for sisters
+4. Choice framework based on her habits, style, age, relationship, and fit
+5. Jewellery ideas by sister style
+6. Mid article BlueStone carousel with six approved products
+7. Editorial recommendation section with six named products, each with a best for use case, reason, and gifting tip
+8. Guidance for an elder sister, younger sister, and sister in law
