+# Week 6 Rank 7 Structure and Visual Plan
+
+## Article engine and publishing frame
+
+* Engine: `gift_guide`
+* Theme: Gift Guides
+* Category: Gift, WordPress ID 554493424
+* Primary keyword: `birthday gift for sister ideas`
+* Slug: `birthday-gift-for-sister-ideas-2026`
+* Target visible length: 2,500 to 3,200 words
+* Competitor URL: absent from the Week 6 CSV
+* Supporting phrases: intent inferred only
+
+## Article structure
+
+1. Direct answer introduction with the primary keyword in the opening paragraph
+2. TL;DR with quick gift directions by style and sizing confidence
+3. Birthday gift quick picks for sisters
+4. Choice framework based on her habits, style, age, relationship, and fit
+5. Jewellery ideas by sister style
+6. Mid article BlueStone carousel with six approved products
+7. Editorial recommendation section with six named products, each with a best for use case, reason, and gifting tip
+8. Guidance for an elder sister, younger sister, and sister in law
+9. Safe choices when her style is uncertain
+10. Personal presentation ideas
+11. Common gifting mistakes
+12. Last minute decision checklist
+13. Related BlueStone reading
+14. Conclusion and soft next step
+15. Eight visible FAQs plus matching FAQPage and BlogPosting schema
+
+## Carousel products
+
+All six products are approved in `Seo Products - final products (1).csv` and have Type 2 source images in `ProductImages/seo images/`.
+
+| SKU | Product | Gift role |
+|---|---|---|
+| BISE0987F55 | The Keeper Multiwearable Charm | versatile style changing gift |
+| BIPO0770U26 | The Ensy Evil Eye Watch Charm | playful gift for a watch lover |
+| BIJP0993R123 | The Viperine Twist Ring | confident statement choice when size is known |
+| BIPN0880H218 | The Nettile Huggie Earrings | polished everyday earrings |
+| BIMG0635V45 | The Shining Star Bracelet | sentimental birthday keepsake |
+| BISW1080P133 | The Lumeelle Cluster Pendant | refined pendant for an elder sister or milestone birthday |
+
+## Type 3 concept
+
+The three slots form one birthday morning story in a warm Indian home. Wrapped boxes, flowers, ribbon, a ceramic cup, and a closed book provide physical context. No screens, blank cards, boards, placards, readable text, logos, or extra jewellery appear.
+
+* Hero: two fair skinned adult Indian sisters sharing a warm birthday gift moment. The recipient physically wears The Rohal Huggie Earrings at the exact body image scale. The featured image is not repeated in the body.
+* Flatlay: The Viperine Twist Ring in a `linen-bedside` setting with rumpled linen, a closed title free book, soft lamp glow, ribbon, and a small wrapped box. No people or hands.
+* Lifestyle: a fair skinned adult Indian sister tying ribbon around a gift while physically wearing The Keeper Multiwearable Charm on a fine bracelet at the exact body image scale.
+
+Type 3 SKU plan:
+
+| Slot | SKU | Product | Body image gate |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| Hero | BIPM0001H28 | The Rohal Huggie Earrings | passed, `1_body_portrait.png` inspected |
+| Flatlay | BIJP0993R123 | The Viperine Twist Ring | not applicable to people, packshot angles available |
+| Lifestyle | BISE0987F55 | The Keeper Multiwearable Charm | passed, necklace and bracelet body images inspected |
+
+Carousel and Type 3 overlap is one SKU, BIJP0993R123. This is within the rotation gate. The previous completed Week 6 flatlay setting was `marble-vanity`, so `linen-bedside` does not repeat it.
+
+Every Type 3 prompt will include the required analog grain, Kodak Portra colour science, highlight halation, creamy bokeh, filmic tonal response, editorial colour grading, and natural dynamic range language.
