+# Week 6 Rank 7 Structure and Visual Plan
+
+## Article engine and publishing frame
+
+* Engine: `gift_guide`
+* Theme: Gift Guides
+* Category: Gift, WordPress ID 554493424
+* Primary keyword: `birthday gift for sister ideas`
+* Slug: `birthday-gift-for-sister-ideas-2026`
+* Target visible length: 2,500 to 3,200 words
+* Competitor URL: absent from the Week 6 CSV
+* Supporting phrases: intent inferred only
+
+## Article structure
+
+1. Direct answer introduction with the primary keyword in the opening paragraph
+2. TL;DR with quick gift directions by style and sizing confidence
+3. Birthday gift quick picks for sisters
+4. Choice framework based on her habits, style, age, relationship, and fit
+5. Jewellery ideas by sister style
+6. Mid article BlueStone carousel with six approved products
+7. Editorial recommendation section with six named products, each with a best for use case, reason, and gifting tip
+8. Guidance for an elder sister, younger sister, and sister in law
+9. Safe choices when her style is uncertain
+10. Personal presentation ideas
+11. Common gifting mistakes
+12. Last minute decision checklist
+13. Related BlueStone reading
+14. Conclusion and soft next step
+15. Eight visible FAQs plus matching FAQPage and BlogPosting schema
+
+## Carousel products
+
+All six products are approved in `Seo Products - final products (1).csv` and have Type 2 source images in `ProductImages/seo images/`.
+
+| SKU | Product | Gift role |
