 small dark central stone held by four gold prongs. Exact ring spacing, exact blue colour, exact round proportions, natural gemstone refraction, true diamond brilliance, realistic gold reflections, 100 percent identical design, zero distortion, sharp HD jewellery fidelity. The Keeper Multiwearable Charm is the single and only jewellery piece. Both sisters wear absolutely no other earrings, rings, bangles, bracelets, necklaces, watches, hair jewellery, or additional charms. Avoid: floating jewellery overlay, giant charm collage, product cutout over people, packshot composited into scene, oversized charm, enlarged gemstones, altered eye pattern, wrong blue colour, extra charms, extra jewellery, distorted hands, extra fingers, cropped hands, cropped wrists, cropped face, cropped head, readable text, letters, numbers, logo, certificate, invoice, phone, laptop, tablet, TV, blank screen, board, placard, card facing camera, dark skin, deep brown skin, heavily tanned skin, illustration, CGI, HDR glow, blown whites."
